  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 513.39 Former Prisoner of War Plate.\n\n(a) Former prisoner of war plates shall be issued to a vehicle owned by a former prisoner of war pursuant to RSA 261:86, I(c).\n\n(b) Former prisoner of war plates shall:\n\n(1) Have the letters \"POW\" on the left vertical border;\n\n(2) Have 3 horizontal barbed-wire symbols; and\n\n(3) Have 3 numerals.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500), EXPIRED: 10-17-11\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12 (from Saf-C 514.37); renumbered by #12914 (formerly Saf-C 514.38); ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 514.38)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
